---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout title="Contact" description="Get in touch with Utkarsh Thaokar.">
  <div class="prose">
  <h1>Contact</h1>

  <p class="lede">
    Have an idea you want help building, a project you'd like a hand
    maintaining, or an open-source repo you think I could contribute to?
    Send me a note &mdash; I read everything.
  </p>

  <p>
    Email: <a href="mailto:thaokarutkarsh@gmail.com">thaokarutkarsh@gmail.com</a>
  </p>

  <p>
    Or find me here:
  </p>
  <ul>
    <li><a href="https://github.com/utk1106" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">GitHub &mdash; github.com/utk1106</a></li>
    <li><a href="https://linkedin.com/in/utkarsh-thaokar" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">LinkedIn &mdash; linkedin.com/in/utkarsh-thaokar</a></li>
  </ul>

  <h2>What I can help with</h2>
  <ul>
    <li>Standing up CI/CD from scratch (GitHub Actions, GitLab CI, Azure DevOps)</li>
    <li>Terraform / infrastructure-as-code, including cleaning up drift-prone setups</li>
    <li>Dockerizing an app and fixing the "why does this only break in prod" problems</li>
    <li>Small full-stack builds (FastAPI/PostgreSQL backend, React frontend)</li>
    <li>Contributing to an existing open-source project &mdash; happy to start small</li>
  </ul>

  <p class="note">
    If you're reaching out about a job or freelance opportunity, a couple lines
    on what you're building and what stage it's at is more useful to me than a
    formal brief &mdash; I'll ask follow-up questions from there.
  </p>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>
